@startuml
title MS5 · Vérification — Modèle de classes (S4)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5A88
skinparam ArrowColor #2E5A88
skinparam FontName Helvetica
skinparam FontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9A400

enum VerificationStatus <<enumeration>> {
  QUEUED
  RUNNING
  COMPLETED
  ERROR
}

enum VerdictResult <<enumeration>> {
  PASS
  FAIL
}

class VerificationRequest <<DTO>> {
  +submissionId: UUID
  +challengeId: UUID
  +repoUrl: URI
  +commitSha: String
  +testCommand: String
}

class Verification <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +submissionId: UUID
  +status: VerificationStatus
  +result: VerdictResult
  +passed: int
  +failed: int
  +total: int
  +coverage: Double
  +durationMs: long
  +sandboxImage: String
  +startedAt: LocalDateTime
  +finishedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +launch(VerificationRequest req): Verification {static}
  +start(): void
  +complete(VerdictResult r): void
  +fail(String reason): void
  +successRate(): double
  +isFinished(): boolean
}

class TestResult <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +testName: String
  +outcome: VerdictResult
  +durationMs: long
  +logs: String
  --
  +isPassed(): boolean
}

class CodeEmbedding <<vector>> {
  +id: UUID
  +submissionId: UUID
  +chunkId: String
  +model: String
  +vector: List~Double~
  --
  +cosineWith(CodeEmbedding other): double
}

class SimilarityMatch <<value object>> {
  +otherSubmissionId: UUID
  +similarity: double
  --
  +isAbove(double threshold): boolean
}

class SimilarityReport <<entity>> {
  +submissionId: UUID
  +challengeId: UUID
  +maxSimilarity: double
  +flagged: boolean
  +matches: List~SimilarityMatch~
  +analyzedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +analyze(UUID submissionId, UUID challengeId): SimilarityReport {static}
  +isFlagged(double threshold): boolean
  +topMatches(int n): List~SimilarityMatch~
}

class PlagiatAlert <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +submissionId: UUID
  +similarity: double
  +matchedSubmissionIds: List~UUID~
  +detectedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +from(SimilarityReport r): PlagiatAlert {static}
  +severity(): String
}

class AiSummary <<optional>> {
  +submissionId: UUID
  +summary: String
  +model: String
  +generatedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +generate(UUID submissionId): AiSummary {static}
}

VerificationRequest "1" --> "1" Verification : déclenche
Verification "1" *-- "0..*" TestResult : produit
Verification "1" --> "0..1" SimilarityReport : déclenche
CodeEmbedding "0..*" ..> "1" SimilarityReport : alimente (pgvector)
SimilarityReport "1" *-- "0..*" SimilarityMatch : contient
SimilarityReport "1" --> "0..1" PlagiatAlert : élève
Verification ..> VerdictResult : result
SimilarityReport ..> AiSummary : contexte jury (optionnel)

note right of Verification
  Exécution asynchrone (202 Accepted).
  Bac à sable isolé : sandboxImage,
  durée max, pas de réseau sortant.
  Le verdict est renvoyé à MS3 via
  PUT /api/submissions/{id}/verdict.
end note

note bottom of SimilarityReport
  Détection déterministe : similarité cosinus
  sur embeddings pgvector, seuil configuré.
  Rapport non bloquant : un signal flagged
  est transmis au jury (similarity.flagged),
  il ne rejette pas la soumission.
end note

note left of AiSummary
  Couche LLM optionnelle : 503 si indisponible,
  la vérification reste opérationnelle.
end note

legend bottom left
  <<vector>> : vecteur stocké dans PostgreSQL + pgvector.
  <<optional>> : amélioration, jamais dans le chemin critique.
end legend
@enduml
